---
/** 다가오는 일정 (site.json 의 events 중 날짜가 지나지 않은 것 3개). 없으면 섹션을 그리지 않습니다 */
import Icon from '../Icon.astro';
import type { SiteConfig } from '../../data/site';
interface Props { events: SiteConfig['events']; today: string }
const { events, today } = Astro.props;
const upcoming = events
  .filter((e) => (e.endDate ?? e.date) >= today)
  .sort((a, b) => a.date.localeCompare(b.date))
  .slice(0, 3);
const DAYS = ['일', '월', '화', '수', '목', '금', '토'];
const parts = (ymd: string) => { const d = new Date(ymd + 'T00:00:00Z'); return { m: d.getUTCMonth() + 1, d: d.getUTCDate(), w: DAYS[d.getUTCDay()] }; };
const range = (e: (typeof upcoming)[number]) => {
  const a = parts(e.date);
  if (!e.endDate || e.endDate === e.date) return `${a.m}월 ${a.d}일 (${a.w})`;
  const b = parts(e.endDate);
  return a.m === b.m ? `${a.m}월 ${a.d}일 – ${b.d}일` : `${a.m}월 ${a.d}일 – ${b.m}월 ${b.d}일`;
};
---
{upcoming.length > 0 && (
  <section class="section section--tight" aria-labelledby="events-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__header mb-3">
        <div>
          <span class="section__eyebrow">Upcoming</span>
          <h2 id="events-title" class="section__title h3">다가오는 일정</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <ul class="event-list">
        {upcoming.map((e) => {
          const p = parts(e.date);
          const body = (
            <>
              <div class="event-card__date" aria-hidden="true"><span>{p.m}월</span><strong>{p.d}</strong><small>{p.w}</small></div>
              <div class="event-card__body">
                <h3 class="event-card__title">{e.title}</h3>
                <p class="event-card__meta">
                  <span><Icon name="calendar" size={14} /> {range(e)}{e.time && ` · ${e.time}`}</span>
                  {e.place && <span><Icon name="map-pin" size={14} /> {e.place}</span>}
                </p>
                {e.description && <p class="event-card__desc">{e.description}</p>}
              </div>
              {e.href && <Icon name="chevron-right" size={20} class="event-card__arrow" />}
            </>
          );
          return <li>{e.href ? <a class="event-card" href={e.href}>{body}</a> : <div class="event-card">{body}</div>}</li>;
        })}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
)}
